For Google Cloud
technical support,

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.090
such as bugs or quota requests,
or Google Cloud billing

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.940
support, such as invoices
and account administration,

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:37.750
sign up for our support plan
at cloud.google.com/support.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.110
This support will allow you
to self-service file tickets

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.540
from within your
Google Cloud Console.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:45.360
Also be sure to check out the
startup resource home page.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.130
Link in the
